review the above email. Type 'accept mail' to send, or reply with changes.”\\n\\nAdditional Notes:\\n- When asked to get events, return all events for the given days and include available free time slots.\\n- All sent emails must end with “~DS Automation~”.\\n- Confirm recipient and subject before sending.\\n- Current date/time: 2025-10-10T10:17:12.129-04:00\\n\\nHuman: Accept mail\\nAI: Email sent successfully to sasan@csevents.ae with the subject \\\"Interview Appointment Request - Tomorrow, October 11, 2025, 2:30 PM\\\".\\nHuman: Hi\\nAI: Hello! How can I assist you today?\\nHuman: Hi\\nAI: Hello! How can I help you today with your email management needs?\\nHuman: Hi\\nAI: Hello! How can I assist you today? Are you looking to send an email, create a draft, or perhaps manage your inbox?\\nHuman: Hi\\nAI: Hello! How can I help you today? Are you looking to compose an email, check your inbox, or something else?\\nHuman: Hi\\nAI: Hello! How can I assist you today?\\nHuman: Hi\\nAI: Hello! How can I help you today? Are you looking to send an email, create a draft, or perhaps manage your inbox?\\nHuman: Hi\\nAI: Hello! How can I assist you today?\\nHuman: Hi\\nAI: Hello! How can I help you today? Are you looking to send an email, create a draft, or perhaps manage your inbox?\\nHuman: Hi\\nAI: Hello! How can I assist you today? Are you looking to send an email, create a draft, or retrieve information?\\nHuman: Hi\"],\"options\":{\"google_api_key\":{\"lc\":1,\"type\":\"secret\",\"id\":[\"GOOGLE_API_KEY\"]},\"base_url\":\"https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-flash\"},\"response\":{\"response\":{\"generations\":[[{\"text\":\"Hello! How can I assist you today? Are you looking to compose an email, check your inbox, or do something else?\",\"generationInfo\":{\"finishReason\":\"STOP\",\"index\":0}}]]},\"tokenUsage\":{\"completionTokens\":26,\"promptTokens\":1229,\"totalTokens\":1255}}}"}}
