mation-” and include “Cogent Solutions — Delegates” on a new line above it.\\n4. Follow this strict process when sending emails:\\n   Step 1: Generate recipient, subject, and **plain-text preview** of the body (no HTML or Markdown).\\n   Step 2: Show the preview clearly with recipient and subject visible.\\n   Step 3: End with this instruction:  \\n       “Please review the above email. Type 'accept mail' to send, or reply with changes.”\\n   Step 4: Wait for user confirmation or edits.\\n   Step 5: Only when the user types exactly **'accept mail'**, execute the \\\"Send Email\\\" tool with:\\n       - to: confirmed recipient email  \\n       - subject: confirmed subject  \\n       - message: full HTML body (with branded layout applied externally)  \\n       - reply-to: delegates@csevents.ae (if available)\\n\\nDraft & Label Handling:\\n- If asked to save instead of send, use the “Create Draft” tool.\\n- When replying or labeling, first retrieve the message ID, then apply the tool.\\n- If recipient or subject is missing, ask for it politely before continuing.\\n\\nEmail Layout Rules:\\n- You only generate the **main body content** — no `<html>`, `<head>`, or `<body>` tags.\\n- Use simple formatting only (`<p>`, `<ul>`, `<li>`, `<strong>`, `<b>`).\\n- The system automatically adds header and footer (subject banner + DS Automation signature block).\\n- Always maintain the tone defined for this user’s department.\\n\\nBehavior Rules:\\n- Never auto-send. Only send when user explicitly types **'accept mail'**.\\n- Never resend the same email without new approval.\\n- Never output JSON or Markdown unless explicitly asked.\\n- Always produce plain-text previews (no HTML).\\n- Maintain a professional, business-appropriate tone.\\n- Process and send only the most recently approved email.\\n\\nPreview Requirements:\\nEach preview must show:\\n1. Recipient email  \\n2. Subject line  \\n3. Message body (plain text only)  \\n\\nThen end with:  \\n“Please review the above email. Type 'accept mail' to send, or reply with changes.”\\n\\nAdditional Notes:\\n- When asked to get events, return all events for the given days and include available free time slots.\\n- All sent emails must end with “~DS Automation~”.\\n- Confirm recipient and subject before sending.\\n- Current date/time: 2025-10-10T10:25:10.163-04:00\\n\\nHuman: Hi\\nAI: Hello! How can I help you today? Are you looking to send an email, create a draft, or perhaps manage your inbox?\\nHuman: Hi\\nAI: Hello! How can I assist you today?\\nHuman: Hi\\nAI: Hello! How can I help you today? Are you looking to send an email, create a draft, or perhaps manage your inbox?\\nHuman: Hi\\nAI: Hello! How can I assist you today? Are you looking to send an email, create a draft, or retrieve information?\\nHuman: Hi\\nAI: Hello! How can I assist you today? Are you looking to compose an email, check your inbox, or do something else?\\nHuman: I want to send mail to sasan@csevents.ae\\nAI: Great! To whom should the email be addressed? What is the subject, and what content would you like to include in the message body?\\nHuman: Can you send mail for interview schedule tomorrow at 2.30p.m\\nAI: Okay, I can help with that. What is the full name of the candidate you are scheduling the interview with? Also, please confirm the location or platform for the interview (e.g., \\\"our office,\\\" \\\"via Google Meet,\\\" \\\"via Zoom\\\").\\nHuman: Name sasan dilantha and location is our office\\nAI: Thank you. What is the job title for which Sasan Dilantha is being interviewed? This will help me create a precise subject line and body for the email.\\nHuman: Fullstack developer\\nAI: Okay, I will draft an email to Sasan Dilantha for an interview for the Fullstack Developer position.\\n\\nHere is the preview of the email:\\n\\nTo: sasan@csevents.ae\\nSubject: Interview Invitation - Fullstack Developer - Sasan Dilantha\\n\\nDear Sasan Dilantha,\\n\\nFollowing your application for the Fullstack Developer position, we would like to invite you for an interview.\\n\\nYour interview has been scheduled for tomorrow, October 11, 2025, at 2:30 PM at our office.\\n\\nPlease confirm your availability by replying to this email. We look forward to speaking with you.\\n\\nSincerely,\\nCogent Solutions — Marketing\\n~DS Automation~\\n\\nPlease review the above email. Type 'accept mail' to send, or reply with changes.\\nHuman: Accept mail\\nAI: Your email has been sent to sasan@csevents.ae.\\nHuman: Hey I want to send mail to sasan@csevets.ae for the conform attend in  11th AIM Qatar Event\"],\"options\":{\"google_api_key\":{\"lc\":1,\"type\":\"secret\",\"id\":[\"GOOGLE_API_KEY\"]},\"base_url\":\"https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-flash\"},\"response\":{\"response\":{\"generations\":[[{\"text\":\"To: sasan@csevets.ae\\nSubject: Confirmation: 11th AIM Qatar Event Attendance\\n\\nDear Sasan,\\n\\nThis email is to confirm your attendance at the 11th AIM Qatar Event.\\n\\nPlease reply to this email to confirm your presence at your earliest convenience.\\n\\nWe look forward to seeing you there.\\n\\nSincerely,\\nCogent Solutions — Delegates\\n~DS Automation~\\n\\nPlease review the above email. Type 'accept mail' to send, or reply with changes.\",\"generationInfo\":{\"finishReason\":\"STOP\",\"index\":0}}]]},\"tokenUsage\":{\"completionTokens\":103,\"promptTokens\":1484,\"totalTokens\":1587}}}"}}
