 Type 'accept mail' to send, or reply with changes.”\\n\\nAdditional Notes:\\n- When asked to get events, return all events for the given days and include available free time slots.\\n- All sent emails must end with “~DS Automation~”.\\n- Confirm recipient and subject before sending.\\n- Current date/time: 2025-10-10T10:26:32.420-04:00\\n\\nHuman: Hi\\nAI: Hello! How can I assist you today?\\nHuman: Hi\\nAI: Hello! How can I help you today? Are you looking to send an email, create a draft, or perhaps manage your inbox?\\nHuman: Hi\\nAI: Hello! How can I assist you today? Are you looking to send an email, create a draft, or retrieve information?\\nHuman: Hi\\nAI: Hello! How can I assist you today? Are you looking to compose an email, check your inbox, or do something else?\\nHuman: I want to send mail to sasan@csevents.ae\\nAI: Great! To whom should the email be addressed? What is the subject, and what content would you like to include in the message body?\\nHuman: Can you send mail for interview schedule tomorrow at 2.30p.m\\nAI: Okay, I can help with that. What is the full name of the candidate you are scheduling the interview with? Also, please confirm the location or platform for the interview (e.g., \\\"our office,\\\" \\\"via Google Meet,\\\" \\\"via Zoom\\\").\\nHuman: Name sasan dilantha and location is our office\\nAI: Thank you. What is the job title for which Sasan Dilantha is being interviewed? This will help me create a precise subject line and body for the email.\\nHuman: Fullstack developer\\nAI: Okay, I will draft an email to Sasan Dilantha for an interview for the Fullstack Developer position.\\n\\nHere is the preview of the email:\\n\\nTo: sasan@csevents.ae\\nSubject: Interview Invitation - Fullstack Developer - Sasan Dilantha\\n\\nDear Sasan Dilantha,\\n\\nFollowing your application for the Fullstack Developer position, we would like to invite you for an interview.\\n\\nYour interview has been scheduled for tomorrow, October 11, 2025, at 2:30 PM at our office.\\n\\nPlease confirm your availability by replying to this email. We look forward to speaking with you.\\n\\nSincerely,\\nCogent Solutions — Marketing\\n~DS Automation~\\n\\nPlease review the above email. Type 'accept mail' to send, or reply with changes.\\nHuman: Accept mail\\nAI: Your email has been sent to sasan@csevents.ae.\\nHuman: Hey I want to send mail to sasan@csevets.ae for the conform attend in  11th AIM Qatar Event\\nAI: To: sasan@csevets.ae\\nSubject: Confirmation: 11th AIM Qatar Event Attendance\\n\\nDear Sasan,\\n\\nThis email is to confirm your attendance at the 11th AIM Qatar Event.\\n\\nPlease reply to this email to confirm your presence at your earliest convenience.\\n\\nWe look forward to seeing you there.\\n\\nSincerely,\\nCogent Solutions — Delegates\\n~DS Automation~\\n\\nPlease review the above email. Type 'accept mail' to send, or reply with changes.\\nHuman: Create more polite  detail mail\"],\"options\":{\"google_api_key\":{\"lc\":1,\"type\":\"secret\",\"id\":[\"GOOGLE_API_KEY\"]},\"base_url\":\"https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-flash\"},\"response\":{\"response\":{\"generations\":[[{\"text\":\"Okay, I will draft a more polite and detailed email for Sasan regarding the 11th AIM Qatar Event.\\n\\nHere is the preview of the email:\\n\\nTo: sasan@csevets.ae\\nSubject: Your Attendance Confirmation: 11th AIM Qatar Event\\n\\nDear Sasan,\\n\\nWe are delighted to confirm your registration and anticipated attendance at the upcoming 11th AIM Qatar Event. We are very much looking forward to your participation.\\n\\nTo ensure all arrangements are in place, kindly confirm your availability and intention to attend the event by replying to this email at your earliest convenience.\\n\\nShould you have any questions or require further assistance regarding your attendance, please do not hesitate to reach out.\\n\\nThank you for being a part of the 11th AIM Qatar Event.\\n\\nSincerely,\\nCogent Solutions — Delegates\\n~DS Automation~\\n\\nPlease review the above email. Type 'accept mail' to send, or reply with changes.\",\"generationInfo\":{\"finishReason\":\"STOP\",\"index\":0}}]]},\"tokenUsage\":{\"completionTokens\":196,\"promptTokens\":1565,\"totalTokens\":1761}}}"}}
